error[impure-lambda]: anonymous function passed to `filter` writes state
 --> src/ImpureLambdaPositive.jl:9:12
  |
9 |     return filter(item -> item in seen ? false : (push!(seen, item); true), items)
  |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `filter` chooses order and number of calls
  |                   -------------------------------------------------------- writes state
  |
  = why: write depends on Base internals, and call that reads as query changes state
  = fix: write loop, or use `foreach`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain impure-lambda
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow impure-lambda -- <reason>`

